# DNS Zone: **${zone_name}**

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Zone** | [Open in STACKIT Portal](${zone_url}) |
| **Domain** | `${zone_name}` |
| **Default TTL** | `${default_ttl}` seconds |
%{ if wildcard_target_ip != null ~}
| **Wildcard record** | `*.${zone_name}` → `${wildcard_target_ip}` |
%{ endif ~}

%{ if wildcard_target_ip != null ~}
Every hostname under `${zone_name}` resolves to `${wildcard_target_ip}`, so an application picks its
own hostname and it works without anyone provisioning a record for it.
%{ else ~}
The zone is empty. Records are created by whoever needs them.
%{ endif ~}
